WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.555 --> 00:00:04.197
WE ARE AMERICANS.

00:00:04.198 --> 00:00:07.139
RIGHT NOW, IT IS OUR DUTY.

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:09.303
AT THE MOMENT, A LOT OF OUR

00:00:09.304 --> 00:00:11.191
LEADERS ARE NOT BEING BRAVE.

00:00:11.225 --> 00:00:13.672
THEY ARE ALLOWING THE MOB TO RUN

00:00:13.673 --> 00:00:14.408
RAMPANT.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.848
TONIGHT, NEW LEAKED AUDIO FROM

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.136
CHICAGO, EXACTLY WHAT WAS GOING

00:00:18.171 --> 00:00:19.447
ON BEHIND THE SCENES.

00:00:19.449 --> 00:00:20.546
IT’S REMARKABLE AND NOT

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:20.816
SURPRISING.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:21.742
CHIEF BREAKING NEWS

00:00:21.743 --> 00:00:22.571
CORRESPONDENT TRACE GALLAGHER

00:00:22.605 --> 00:00:24.309
HAS IT ALL ON TAPE.

00:00:24.343 --> 00:00:26.408
&gt;&gt; THIS WAS A CONFERENCE CALL ON

00:00:26.409 --> 00:00:28.023
SUNDAY, MAY 31ST TO TALK ABOUT

00:00:28.024 --> 00:00:28.881
CHICAGO’S RESPONSE TO THE

00:00:28.882 --> 00:00:30.523
WIDESPREAD LOOTING.

00:00:30.524 --> 00:00:33.033
ON THE CALL WHERE

00:00:33.034 --> 00:00:35.487
MAYOR LORI LIGHTFOOT AN OLDER

00:00:35.489 --> 00:00:36.975
WOMAN INCLUDING ALDERMAN RAYMOND

00:00:36.976 --> 00:00:38.333
LOPEZ, ONE OF THE MAYOR’S

00:00:38.335 --> 00:00:38.966
HARSHEST CRITICS.

00:00:38.967 --> 00:00:42.609
FOR CONTEXT, ON THE DAY OF THE

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:47.042
CONFERENCE CALL, CHICAGO HAD 699

00:00:47.043 --> 00:00:49.722
ARRESTS, MOSTLY LOOTERS, THERE

00:00:49.757 --> 00:00:51.609
WERE 48 SHOOTINGS, 17 HOMICIDES,

00:00:51.644 --> 00:00:54.207
AND ALDERMAN LOPEZ ACCUSE THE

00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:56.007
MAYOR OF BEING UNDERPREPARED AS

00:00:56.041 --> 00:00:57.352
THE LOOTING SPREAD SAYING HIS

00:00:57.353 --> 00:00:59.414
WARD HAD BECOME A VIRTUAL

00:00:59.415 --> 00:01:00.091
WAR ZONE.

00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:00.668
LISTEN.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:02.275
&gt;&gt; HAVE OUR NEIGHBORHOODS ARE

00:01:02.276 --> 00:01:03.659
ALREADY OBLITERATED.

00:01:03.661 --> 00:01:05.430
IT’S TOO LATE.

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:08.441
WE HAVE TO COME UP WITH A BETTER

00:01:08.475 --> 00:01:10.116
PLAN BECAUSE MY FEAR IS ONCE

00:01:10.118 --> 00:01:11.654
THEY ARE DONE LOOTING IN WRITING

00:01:11.688 --> 00:01:14.587
AND WHATEVER IS GOING TO HAPPEN

00:01:14.622 --> 00:01:16.559
TONIGHT, GOD HELP US, WHAT

00:01:16.593 --> 00:01:17.797
HAPPENS WHEN THEY START GOING

00:01:17.799 --> 00:01:19.206
AFTER RESIDENTS?

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:20.787
GOING INTO THE NEIGHBORHOODS?

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:22.926
ONCE THEY START TRYING TO BREAK

00:01:22.928 --> 00:01:24.578
DOWN PEOPLES DOORS BECAUSE THEY

00:01:24.612 --> 00:01:26.023
THINK THEY GOT SOMETHING.

00:01:26.058 --> 00:01:27.526
WE KNOW THAT PEOPLE ARE HERE TO

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:29.618
ANTAGONIZE AND INSIGHT, AND

00:01:29.652 --> 00:01:31.355
YOU’VE GOT THEM ALL PUMPED

00:01:31.356 --> 00:01:32.019
TONIGHT.

00:01:32.054 --> 00:01:37.507
TODAY, THEY WON’T GO TO BED AT

00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:37.947
8:00.

00:01:37.948 --> 00:01:40.473
WALKING AROUND RIGHT NOW JUST

00:01:40.474 --> 00:01:42.826
WAITING TO SETTLE SOME SCORES.

00:01:42.827 --> 00:01:47.002
WHAT ARE WE GOING TO DO?

00:01:47.004 --> 00:01:48.979
&gt;&gt; Tucker:&gt;&gt; THE ALDERMAN WASN’T

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:49.345
EXAGGERATING.

00:01:49.346 --> 00:01:52.680
IN AN ENTIRE STRIP MALL WAS

00:01:52.682 --> 00:01:54.675
BURNED DOWN BUT WHEN HE FINISHED

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.135
SPEAKING, MAYOR LIGHTFOOT

00:01:56.169 --> 00:02:00.253
REFUSED TO RESPOND AND FINALLY

00:02:00.287 --> 00:02:03.938
SHE DID, WATCH.

00:02:03.939 --> 00:02:06.381
&gt;&gt; IF YOU THINK.

00:02:06.415 --> 00:02:09.395
&gt;&gt; WHO ARE YOU TO TELL ME I AM

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:10.951
FULL OF [BLEEP]?

00:02:10.985 --> 00:02:13.847
&gt;&gt; IF YOU THINK WE ARE NOT

00:02:13.848 --> 00:02:15.129
READY, LET THE NEIGHBORHOOD GO

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:16.587
UP, NOTHING INTELLIGENT THAT I

00:02:16.589 --> 00:02:17.809
CAN SAY TO YOU.

00:02:17.843 --> 00:02:19.078
&gt;&gt; MAYBE YOU SHOULD COME OUT AND

00:02:19.112 --> 00:02:20.585
SEE WHAT’S GOING ON.

00:02:20.587 --> 00:02:22.000
&gt;&gt; THAT IS THE STUPIDEST THING I

00:02:22.034 --> 00:02:23.890
HAVE EVER HEARD.

00:02:23.924 --> 00:02:25.829
I UNDERSTAND YOU WANT TO PREEN

00:02:25.863 --> 00:02:26.587
IT, I UNDERSTAND.

00:02:26.589 --> 00:02:27.303
UNDERSTAND.

00:02:27.338 --> 00:02:29.949
&gt;&gt; YOU NEED TO CHECK YOUR

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:30.844
[BLEEP] ATTITUDE.

00:02:30.845 --> 00:02:32.484
&gt;&gt; THE OTHER ALDERMAN JUMPED IN

00:02:32.519 --> 00:02:34.465
THE ALDERMAN LOPEZ ON THE MAYOR

00:02:34.499 --> 00:02:35.791
WERE THE ONLY ONES TRADING

00:02:35.825 --> 00:02:36.305
PROFANITIES.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.136
ANOTHER OLDER WOMAN WAS SAYING

00:02:38.137 --> 00:02:40.111
THIS IS A TOTAL BLANK SHOW AND

00:02:40.145 --> 00:02:41.991
ADDED THAT SHE’D NEVER SEEN

00:02:41.992 --> 00:02:43.574
BLANK LIKE THIS BEFORE IT.

00:02:43.608 --> 00:02:44.924
ONE ALDERMAN FINALLY SPOKE UP

00:02:44.958 --> 00:02:46.979
SAYING MANY PEOPLE IN THE CITY

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:49.250
WERE LISTENING TO THE CALL

00:02:49.284 --> 00:02:49.470
INCLUDING CHILDREN.

